{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"ac17f0f48d82c2f4d89d006ce72cf3ce3ac70717dce819f3cb2f416f1d302617","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"e1343327ead953361b1fefe6fb85fd1569679eb6b9a269a08a6f5c1c8a473152","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"“每回合吸取 %d 体力”误示从目标处吸取体力；固定提交 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63 的 game/modules/tome/data/timed_effects/physical.lua:1429-1435 实际由抓取者执行 self:incStamina(-eff.drain)，是消耗自身生命力。"},{"revision_key":"e200845e1abc8076051b8f755bd28ff1bfe68ebb7009b6c15f1b022aaecd461a","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"“减少……敌人的意志”会表述成降低意志属性这一额外机制；固定提交 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63 的 game/modules/tome/data/timed_effects/mental.lua:280-283 仅降低 combat_def，并禁用 evasion 及不可见造成的未命中，没有降低意志属性。"}]}